{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"story_wintim_set_1_story_1","storyGroup":"story_wintim_set_1","storySort":0,"storyDependence":null,"storyCanShow":0,"storyCode":null,"storyName":"覆录","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"年少的科谢尼娅曾获得一件特殊的礼物，用以记录此后人生中每个珍贵的瞬间。然而多年后，当她拾起那些过去，才发现手中空空如也。","storyCanEnter":0,"storyTxt":"obt/memory/story_wintim_1_1","avgTag":"幕间","unLockType":"STAGE_CLEAR","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":0,"requiredStages":null,"characters":["？？？","年迈的教师","军人","女孩","校长","圆脸女孩","镜头外的声音","菲林研究者","稚嫩的声音","少女","模糊的喊声","青年女子","愤怒的喊声","威严的声音","焦急的喊声","女子","惊讶的声音","愤怒的声音","科谢尼娅","楼下的声音","门外的声音","弑君者","冬时"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"stopmusic","id":1},{"type":"dialog","id":2},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":3},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":4},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a9/Avg_bg_66_g10_instituteinterior.png","screenadapt":"showall","id":5},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":6},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_formal_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":7,"musicid":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.5","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":8},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","text":"","id":9},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","id":10},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":11},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4208_wintim_1#1$2","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","focus":"m","duration":"1","id":12},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":13},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"没有，没有……还是没有。","id":14,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7b/Avg_avg_4208_wintim_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":15},{"type":"charslot","id":16},{"type":"text","text":"没有空白的录像带了。这个不是，那个也用过了……翻遍柜子，她也没有找到一盘全新的。","id":17},{"type":"text","text":"她应该更早意识到这一点的。","id":18},{"type":"text","text":"现在恐怕方圆百里内，都找不到哪里卖这种既不能吃也不能用的非生活必需品。","id":19},{"type":"text","text":"但时间不等人，他们很快就要来了。","id":20},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4208_wintim_1#1$2","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","focus":"m","id":21},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"等等，也许……","id":22,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7b/Avg_avg_4208_wintim_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":23},{"type":"charslot","id":24},{"type":"text","text":"她看向那些被胡乱堆在一边的录像带。它们每一个上面都贴着纸条，写着编号与日期，提示着它们刻录下的光阴。","id":25},{"type":"text","text":"但也许其中有些内容并不重要。她可以抹除上面的东西，拿来录制新的内容。","id":26},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4208_wintim_1#1$2","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","focus":"m","id":27},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"对，就这么办。","id":28,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7b/Avg_avg_4208_wintim_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":29},{"type":"charslot","id":30},{"type":"text","text":"编号是“1”的那盘录像带刚巧就在她的手边。她将它塞进了手边的摄像机中，按下播放键。","id":31},{"type":"dialog","id":32},{"type":"charslot","id":33},{"type":"dialog","id":34},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":35},{"type":"charslot","id":36},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":37},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_filmprojection","id":38},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_oldtvelectricity","loop":"true","channel":"fi","id":39},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4c/Avg_bg_bg_schoolyard.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":40},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0.5","fadetime":"0","keep":"true","id":41},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":42},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_092","focus":"m","id":43},{"type":"dialogue","name":"年迈的教师","text":"我瞧瞧，是这么用吗？这新潮的玩意真叫人弄不明白……哦！已经开始录了。","id":44,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/99/Avg_avg_npc_092.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"年迈的教师","text":"咳，今天是个值得纪念的日子，虽然男爵本人很遗憾没能到场，但他派来了别利亚科夫准尉参加表彰大会……瞧，准尉来了！","id":45,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/99/Avg_avg_npc_092.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":46},{"type":"text","text":"闪烁噪点的老旧画面一阵摇晃，镜头指向了不远处搭建在露天操场上的小小颁奖台。","id":47},{"type":"text","text":"寒风中裹着冬衣的孩子们吸着发红的鼻子，注视着厚重军装打扮的男子上台。","id":48},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1976_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":49},{"type":"dialogue","name":"军人","text":"数年来男爵阁下积极响应陛下的号召，一直为具有天赋却苦于出身贫寒的孩子们提供援助，以培育祖国栋梁之材为己任。","id":50,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_npc_1976_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"军人","text":"蒙陛下的恩泽——我们骄傲地宣布，科谢尼娅·马尔科芙娜·涅留朵娃同学考取了我国最顶尖的学府帝国理工大学！","id":51,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_npc_1976_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"军人","text":"在男爵阁下赞助的数十名天才少年之中，她是最出色的那一个。告诉我，孩子，你未来的目标是什么？","id":52,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_npc_1976_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":53},{"type":"dialogue","name":"女孩","text":"我会进入最顶尖的研究所，研究出造福整个乌萨斯的成果，让我们伟大的祖国更加美好强盛！","id":54},{"type":"text","text":"女孩稚嫩却坚定的声音引得掌声雷动，她骄傲地挺起胸膛。","id":55},{"type":"charslot","id":56},{"type":"dialogue","name":"校长","text":"说得好，说得好！拉古诺夫老师代表我们为你准备了礼物，现在我们请他上来。","id":57},{"type":"text","text":"随着台上人的示意，镜头开始向前，直到画面中出现一张红扑扑的脸蛋。","id":58},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_092","focus":"m","id":59},{"type":"dialogue","name":"年迈的教师","text":"拿着吧，这是老师们一起买给你的。我们都很荣幸做过你的老师……也许这是我这辈子最光荣的事了。","id":60,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/99/Avg_avg_npc_092.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_092","focus":"m","id":61},{"type":"dialogue","name":"年迈的教师","text":"孩子，你拥有无限的可能性，今后一定还会迎来更多这样的时刻，你可以用这个把那些有意义的瞬间记录下来。","id":62,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/99/Avg_avg_npc_092.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_092","focus":"m","id":63},{"type":"dialogue","name":"年迈的教师","text":"知道怎么用吗？按这里是开始录像，那个是……哎哟，别！那是停——","id":64,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/99/Avg_avg_npc_092.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":65},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_filmprojection","id":66},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"fi","id":67},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":68},{"type":"charslot","id":69},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":70},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0","fadetime":"0","keep":"true","id":71},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a9/Avg_bg_66_g10_instituteinterior.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":72},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.5","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":73},{"type":"text","text":"画面中断了，徒留恼人的雪花音回响在寂寥的室内。","id":74},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4208_wintim_1#1$2","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","focus":"m","id":75},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"这拍的……是谁？","id":76,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7b/Avg_avg_4208_wintim_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4208_wintim_1#1$2","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","focus":"m","id":77},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"啊，是了，是了……看来我想的没错。","id":78,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7b/Avg_avg_4208_wintim_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":79},{"type":"charslot","id":80},{"type":"text","text":"这种老式的摄像机并不具有单独删除录像带上内容的功能，但总有方法可以解决这个问题。","id":81},{"type":"text","text":"她按下倒带键，待马达运转与磁带摩擦的声响停歇后，又按下录制键。","id":82},{"type":"text","text":"原有的内容被尽数覆盖。待闪烁的“REC”指示灯熄灭，她便获得了一盘空录像带。","id":83},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4208_wintim_1#1$2","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","focus":"m","id":84},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"这样就好了。","id":85,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7b/Avg_avg_4208_wintim_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":86},{"type":"charslot","id":87},{"type":"text","text":"她的余光瞥见堆积如山的其余录像带。","id":88},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4208_wintim_1#1$2","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","focus":"m","id":89},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"……也许还有其他的也和这盘一样。","id":90,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7b/Avg_avg_4208_wintim_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":91},{"type":"charslot","id":92},{"type":"text","text":"拍的内容毫无意义，只是白白占着地方。","id":93},{"type":"text","text":"她将手伸向另一盘带子。","id":94},{"type":"dialog","id":95},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":96},{"type":"charslot","id":97},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":98},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_filmprojection","id":99},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_oldtvelectricity","loop":"true","channel":"fi","id":100},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/21/Avg_bg_bg_snowconutry_4.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":101},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0.5","fadetime":"0","keep":"true","id":102},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":103},{"type":"charslot","id":104},{"type":"dialogue","name":"圆脸女孩","text":"能不能别捣鼓你的那个怪机器了，科谢尼娅？等把它不小心摔了有你哭的！","id":105},{"type":"charslot","id":106},{"type":"dialogue","name":"镜头外的声音","text":"放心，我拿得可稳了。倒是你，小心像那年体操节一样摔个四脚朝天，把好不容易买的新衣服弄脏了。","id":107},{"type":"text","text":"摇晃的画面中出现了一座被白雪覆盖的村庄，镜头中背着高高一摞薪柴的女孩涨红了脸，拾起一捧雪砸了过来。","id":108},{"type":"charslot","id":109},{"type":"dialogue","name":"圆脸女孩","text":"好哇，你又拿那件事打趣我！我今年长高了不少，要是再跑一次，可不会输给你了！","id":110},{"type":"charslot","id":111},{"type":"dialogue","name":"镜头外的声音","text":"谁说的，比比看？","id":112},{"type":"charslot","id":113},{"type":"dialogue","name":"圆脸女孩","text":"比就比！瞧你这细胳膊细腿……那个什么理工不管饭的吗？","id":114},{"type":"charslot","id":115},{"type":"dialogue","name":"镜头外的声音","text":"怎么可能，食堂里每天都有白面包和热乎乎的肉汤呢！我只是……有的时候忙，没空吃而已。","id":116},{"type":"charslot","id":117},{"type":"dialogue","name":"圆脸女孩","text":"那边的其他学生是不是都是城里来的大孩子？他们……有没有排挤你？","id":118},{"type":"charslot","id":119},{"type":"dialogue","name":"镜头外的声音","text":"无所谓，本来我也不喜欢和他们打交道，正好能省出时间看书。","id":120},{"type":"charslot","id":121},{"type":"dialogue","name":"圆脸女孩","text":"你还是那么喜欢看书，小心把眼睛看坏了，将来像校长一样戴个瓶底厚的眼镜。","id":122},{"type":"charslot","id":123},{"type":"dialogue","name":"镜头外的声音","text":"不看不行，那里有很多厉害的人。","id":124},{"type":"charslot","id":125},{"type":"dialogue","name":"圆脸女孩","text":"比你还聪明？那你不再是全校第一了？","id":126},{"type":"charslot","id":127},{"type":"dialogue","name":"镜头外的声音","text":"这……还不知道呢，今年还没到综合排名的时候……不过我拿到了跟教授参加校外研究的名额，全校就我一个！","id":128},{"type":"charslot","id":129},{"type":"dialogue","name":"镜头外的声音","text":"所以下个假期我就不回来了——啊，到你家了。","id":130},{"type":"dialog","id":131},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","volume":"1","id":132},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":133},{"type":"charslot","id":134},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":135},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1b/Avg_bg_53_g16_sunnyday_L1.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":136},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":137},{"type":"text","text":"镜头一阵摇晃，像是被临时塞到了拍摄者的口袋里，仰面朝向冬日的晴空。","id":138},{"type":"charslot","id":139},{"type":"dialogue","name":"镜头外的声音","text":"拿着，把我的这捆柴也带回去吧。","id":140},{"type":"charslot","id":141},{"type":"dialogue","name":"圆脸女孩","text":"你这是做什么？","id":142},{"type":"charslot","id":143},{"type":"dialogue","name":"镜头外的声音","text":"你家棚子里都空了，就拿着吧。你爷爷……还在的时候，也经常照顾我们家呢。","id":144},{"type":"charslot","id":145},{"type":"dialogue","name":"圆脸女孩","text":"那你们够用吗？","id":146},{"type":"charslot","id":147},{"type":"dialogue","name":"镜头外的声音","text":"操那些多余的心做什么？我可是学能源的，总不会把自己冻死。","id":148},{"type":"charslot","id":149},{"type":"dialogue","name":"镜头外的声音","text":"等再过几年我研究出更安全、更便宜的新能源炉子，到时候不用上山拾柴，屋子也总会是暖烘烘的，谁也不会挨冻。","id":150},{"type":"charslot","id":151},{"type":"dialogue","name":"圆脸女孩","text":"……我还以为你说那种话，是用来哄贵族老爷开心的呢。","id":152},{"type":"charslot","id":153},{"type":"dialogue","name":"镜头外的声音","text":"呃，一部分是啦。他们愿意花钱赞助我们这种没背景的小孩，其实就是为了听我们这么说，好向上面邀功……","id":154},{"type":"charslot","id":155},{"type":"dialogue","name":"镜头外的声音","text":"但也不全是说来糊弄他们的。毕竟你看，我这么厉害……嘿嘿，将来这些肯定都是小菜一碟。","id":156},{"type":"dialog","id":157},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_filmprojection","id":158},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"fi","id":159},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":160},{"type":"charslot","id":161},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":162},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0","fadetime":"0","keep":"true","id":163},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a9/Avg_bg_66_g10_instituteinterior.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":164},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.5","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":165},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4208_wintim_1#1$2","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","focus":"m","id":166},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"果然，这盘也一样。","id":167,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7b/Avg_avg_4208_wintim_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":168},{"type":"charslot","id":169},{"type":"text","text":"停止，倒带，录制。","id":170},{"type":"text","text":"很快，当内置马达停止运转时，这盘录像带上的内容也被清洗一空。","id":171},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4208_wintim_1#1$2","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","focus":"m","id":172},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"……","id":173,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7b/Avg_avg_4208_wintim_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":174},{"type":"charslot","id":175},{"type":"text","text":"窗外北风呼啸。她拿起又一盘录像带。","id":176},{"type":"dialog","id":177},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":178},{"type":"charslot","id":179},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":180},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_filmprojection","id":181},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_oldtvelectricity","loop":"true","channel":"fi","id":182},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/55/Avg_bg_bg_graduate.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":183},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0.5","fadetime":"0","keep":"true","id":184},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":185},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"char_003_kalts_1#1","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","focus":"m","id":186},{"type":"dialogue","name":"菲林研究者","text":"数据我都看了，确实和我们原先的预计存在出入，我会建议调整这边的变量——嗯？","id":187,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d3/Avg_char_003_kalts_1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":188},{"type":"charslot","id":189},{"type":"text","text":"远处正和其他研究员交流着的女子似乎察觉到了什么，向镜头的方向望了过来。","id":190},{"type":"charslot","id":191},{"type":"dialogue","name":"稚嫩的声音","text":"……唔！","id":192},{"type":"text","text":"镜头立刻做贼心虚般调转方向，慌慌忙忙地穿过各式仪器、跃过遍布的电线。最终，它在一个偏僻的角落停了下来。","id":193},{"type":"charslot","id":194},{"type":"dialogue","name":"稚嫩的声音","text":"啊……科谢尼娅。","id":195},{"type":"text","text":"画面中出现了一个缩在墙角阴影中的少女。","id":196},{"type":"text","text":"那是一个黎博利，样貌和第一盘录像带里颁奖台上的女孩十分相似，只是个子拔高了不少，鼻梁上架起了一副黑框眼镜。","id":197},{"type":"charslot","id":198},{"type":"dialogue","name":"少女","text":"柳达？什么事——你怎么把这个翻出来了？快放下！这里不让录像，被所长发现咱们都得挨骂！","id":199},{"type":"text","text":"镜头于是乖顺地朝向了地面，少女发红的眼角一闪而过。","id":200},{"type":"charslot","id":201},{"type":"dialogue","name":"稚嫩的声音","text":"他们又凶你了？我听爸爸说，你的什么……权限被没收了？","id":202},{"type":"charslot","id":203},{"type":"dialogue","name":"少女","text":"是我自己急功近利……做了错事。","id":204},{"type":"charslot","id":205},{"type":"dialogue","name":"少女","text":"听好，我要回学校替伊利亚老师取一份资料。这期间你要乖乖的，等我回来再陪你玩，好吗？","id":206},{"type":"charslot","id":207},{"type":"dialogue","name":"稚嫩的声音","text":"跑腿？","id":208},{"type":"charslot","id":209},{"type":"dialogue","name":"少女","text":"……其他人都比我厉害，手头有更重要的工作。","id":210},{"type":"charslot","id":211},{"type":"dialogue","name":"稚嫩的声音","text":"可他们都是大人！比咱们大那么多呢！这不是在欺负人吗？","id":212},{"type":"text","text":"年幼的拍摄者义愤填膺地晃动起手中的摄像机，原本垂下的镜头中晃过少女的苦笑。","id":213},{"type":"charslot","id":214},{"type":"dialogue","name":"少女","text":"不是的，有些差距……和年龄没关系。","id":215},{"type":"charslot","id":216},{"type":"dialogue","name":"少女","text":"从前周围人总说我是天才、是他们见过最聪明的孩子，我就信了。","id":217},{"type":"charslot","id":218},{"type":"dialogue","name":"少女","text":"可乌萨斯那么大，多的是比我更聪明的天才，我……其实根本排不上号。","id":219},{"type":"text","text":"片刻后，镜头外的少女长舒一口气。","id":220},{"type":"charslot","id":221},{"type":"dialogue","name":"少女","text":"——不过，跑腿就跑腿吧！","id":222},{"type":"charslot","id":223},{"type":"dialogue","name":"少女","text":"不管是多小的事，只要能帮上忙就好。","id":224},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_filmprojection","id":225},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"fi","id":226},{"type":"dialog","id":227},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":228},{"type":"charslot","id":229},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":230},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0","fadetime":"0","keep":"true","id":231},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a9/Avg_bg_66_g10_instituteinterior.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":232},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.5","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":233},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4208_wintim_1#1$2","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","focus":"m","id":234},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"哈……多么可笑。","id":235,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7b/Avg_avg_4208_wintim_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":236},{"type":"text","text":"停止，倒带，录制——她的动作愈发娴熟。","id":237},{"type":"text","text":"清空的录像带被抽出后随手丢到一边，又一盘被塞入带仓。","id":238},{"type":"dialog","id":239},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":240},{"type":"charslot","id":241},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":242},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_filmprojection","id":243},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_oldtvelectricity","loop":"true","channel":"fi","id":244},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9a/Avg_bg_bg_hotel.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":245},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0.5","fadetime":"0","keep":"true","id":246},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":247},{"type":"charslot","id":248},{"type":"dialogue","name":"少女","text":"今天……我就不出镜了。这几天都没怎么收拾自己，实在有些不得体。","id":249},{"type":"charslot","id":250},{"type":"dialogue","name":"少女","text":"我怕错过消息，还在上次的旅店里。但剩下的钱不多了，明天就必须搬出去了。","id":251},{"type":"charslot","id":252},{"type":"dialogue","name":"少女","text":"我还是联系不上任何一个人，申请也没有通过，还是老一套的说辞……他们说这是机密。","id":253},{"type":"charslot","id":254},{"type":"dialogue","name":"少女","text":"……我不被允许回去，也不被允许了解究竟发生了什么。只有我。","id":255},{"type":"charslot","id":256},{"type":"dialogue","name":"少女","text":"的确，我是不如其他人。可我还以为哪怕是再不起眼的脏活累活也好，至少我能帮上些忙，只要日积月累，总有一天……","id":257},{"type":"charslot","id":258},{"type":"dialogue","name":"少女","text":"看来，我还是太自以为是了。","id":259},{"type":"charslot","id":260},{"type":"dialogue","name":"少女","text":"……","id":261},{"type":"charslot","id":262},{"type":"dialogue","name":"少女","text":"也许这是件好事。我该及时认清自己，为接下来做打算了。只是有些对不起柳达……不知道什么时候才能再见面。","id":263},{"type":"text","text":"少女深吸了一口气，让窗外透进来的阳光重新点亮自己的双眼。","id":264},{"type":"charslot","id":265},{"type":"dialogue","name":"少女","text":"我想好了，明天我就收拾行李，去阿尔乔姆先生介绍的那个实验室。","id":266},{"type":"charslot","id":267},{"type":"dialogue","name":"少女","text":"我看过了他们的资料，虽然肯定比不上凯尔希所长那里，但……总也是个不错的去处。","id":268},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_filmprojection","id":269},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"fi","id":270},{"type":"dialog","id":271},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":272},{"type":"charslot","id":273},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":274},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0","fadetime":"0","keep":"true","id":275},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a9/Avg_bg_66_g10_instituteinterior.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":276},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.5","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":277},{"type":"charslot","id":278},{"type":"dialogue","name":"模糊的喊声","text":"……！","id":279},{"type":"text","text":"门外隐约传来一些动静，夹在哀鸣的风声中钻入耳中。","id":280},{"type":"text","text":"再一次——停止，倒带，录制。","id":281},{"type":"text","text":"逐渐变得麻木而机械化的作业中，又一盘被清空的录像带被丢弃一旁。","id":282},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4208_wintim_1#1$2","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","focus":"m","id":283},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"……","id":284,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7b/Avg_avg_4208_wintim_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":285},{"type":"text","text":"她的手指微微颤抖着。","id":286},{"type":"dialog","id":287},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":288},{"type":"charslot","id":289},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":290},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_filmprojection","id":291},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_oldtvelectricity","loop":"true","channel":"fi","id":292},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c7/Avg_bg_bg_ibindoor.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":293},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0.5","fadetime":"0","keep":"true","id":294},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":295},{"type":"text","text":"短暂的杂音过后，画面映出一间昏暗的房间和身材单薄的女子。","id":296},{"type":"text","text":"她眼神飘忽，脸色苍白，双颊却隐约泛着一抹酡红。躺倒在房间角落的空瓶或许暗示着原因。","id":297},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4208_wintim_1#1$2","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","focus":"m","id":298},{"type":"dialogue","name":"青年女子","text":"我知道，我已经很久没有记录了……这些年实在没有什么可以拍的。","id":299,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7b/Avg_avg_4208_wintim_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4208_wintim_1#1$2","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","focus":"m","id":300},{"type":"dialogue","name":"青年女子","text":"算起来……这已经是我辗转的第五个研究所了，来这边也已经过去了半年。","id":301,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7b/Avg_avg_4208_wintim_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4208_wintim_1#1$2","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","focus":"m","id":302},{"type":"dialogue","name":"青年女子","text":"当我的课题好不容易被批准通过的时候，我还以为这里会有所不同……结果没有什么不一样。","id":303,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7b/Avg_avg_4208_wintim_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4208_wintim_1#1$2","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","focus":"m","id":304},{"type":"dialogue","name":"青年女子","text":"昨天课题被叫停了，他们说经费不够，要给更重要的项目。我们做了那么多，事到如今……","id":305,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7b/Avg_avg_4208_wintim_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":306},{"type":"charslot","id":307},{"type":"text","text":"她垂下头沉默了片刻，将手旁杯中的液体灌入口中后，才重新开口。","id":308},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4208_wintim_1#1$2","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","focus":"m","id":309},{"type":"dialogue","name":"青年女子","text":"更重要的项目……无非就是能用在军队上的，和大概率能用在军队上的……就这点区别。","id":310,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7b/Avg_avg_4208_wintim_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4208_wintim_1#1$2","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","focus":"m","id":311},{"type":"dialogue","name":"青年女子","text":"季娜伊达走了。她说怕无法胜任工作……我知道她是不愿意自己的成果被拿去杀人。","id":312,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7b/Avg_avg_4208_wintim_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4208_wintim_1#1$2","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","focus":"m","id":313},{"type":"dialogue","name":"青年女子","text":"我不也一样……可我们真的一样吗？父亲和母亲都上了年纪，他们还在等着我把工资寄回去。","id":314,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7b/Avg_avg_4208_wintim_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4208_wintim_1#1$2","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","focus":"m","id":315},{"type":"dialogue","name":"青年女子","text":"自从那片林子被划作男爵的私产，捡拾柴火也成了重罪。现在木炭的价格那么贵……我需要这笔钱。","id":316,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7b/Avg_avg_4208_wintim_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":317},{"type":"charslot","id":318},{"type":"text","text":"她为自己灌下又一杯液体。","id":319},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4208_wintim_1#1$2","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","focus":"m","id":320},{"type":"dialogue","name":"青年女子","text":"明天我就要去新的课题小组报道，去做那些……能批下来经费的研究。","id":321,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7b/Avg_avg_4208_wintim_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4208_wintim_1#1$2","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","focus":"m","id":322},{"type":"dialogue","name":"青年女子","text":"我暂时应该不会再记录什么了。","id":323,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7b/Avg_avg_4208_wintim_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_filmprojection","id":324},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"fi","id":325},{"type":"dialog","id":326},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":327},{"type":"charslot","id":328},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":329},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0","fadetime":"0","keep":"true","id":330},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a9/Avg_bg_66_g10_instituteinterior.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":331},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.5","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":332},{"type":"charslot","id":333},{"type":"dialogue","name":"愤怒的喊声","text":"没有……一个都没有！那些混账全都跑了！","id":334},{"type":"charslot","id":335},{"type":"dialogue","name":"威严的声音","text":"不急着追，分头找找看有没有什么补给。","id":336},{"type":"charslot","id":337},{"type":"dialogue","name":"威严的声音","text":"这边有吃的，有不少呢！","id":338},{"type":"charslot","id":339},{"type":"dialogue","name":"焦急的喊声","text":"我到楼上去看看有没有药！","id":340},{"type":"text","text":"最初，她还以为自己又犯了老毛病。直到那些声响越来越清晰，她才意识到那不是幻觉。","id":341},{"type":"text","text":"——他们来了。","id":342},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4208_wintim_1#1$2","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","focus":"m","id":343},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"得抓紧了……我得抓紧了。","id":344,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7b/Avg_avg_4208_wintim_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":345},{"type":"text","text":"她如梦方醒。现在有这么多的空录像带，要在生命的最后时刻留下一两句话，已绰绰有余。","id":346},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4208_wintim_1#1$2","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","focus":"m","id":347},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"可是……说些什么好呢？","id":348,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7b/Avg_avg_4208_wintim_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4208_wintim_1#1$2","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","focus":"m","id":349},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"……","id":350,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7b/Avg_avg_4208_wintim_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":351},{"type":"text","text":"正要将带子置入仓内的手，又无力地放了下来。","id":352},{"type":"text","text":"她没有头绪，是时候正视这一点了。这就是她不断拖延、磨蹭、观看这些旧带子的原因。","id":353},{"type":"text","text":"最初拿到这台摄像机时她爱不释手，羽毛蒜皮的事也要记录一番，有段时间非得父母几番催促，她才舍得放下它坐到餐桌前……","id":354},{"type":"text","text":"可如今，她却察觉到自己甚至害怕面对镜头。","id":355},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4208_wintim_1#1$2","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","focus":"m","id":356},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"上一次拍……是什么时候来着？","id":357,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7b/Avg_avg_4208_wintim_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":358},{"type":"text","text":"她开始翻找。在过去的海洋中，她发现了日期更近的一盘。","id":359},{"type":"text","text":"那是她拍摄的最后一盘录像带。","id":360},{"type":"dialog","id":361},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":362},{"type":"charslot","id":363},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":364},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_filmprojection","id":365},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_oldtvelectricity","loop":"true","channel":"fi","id":366},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e3/Avg_bg_66_g9_institutecorridor.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":367},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0.5","fadetime":"0","keep":"true","id":368},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":369},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4208_wintim_1#1$2","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","focus":"m","id":370},{"type":"dialogue","name":"女子","text":"啊，有画面了。行李一路放在货舱里，我还担心会不会已经被冻坏了……幸好。","id":371,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7b/Avg_avg_4208_wintim_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4208_wintim_1#1$2","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","focus":"m","id":372},{"type":"dialogue","name":"女子","text":"这里是布列斯克下辖的远北中心矿区研究所，是我到过的最北边的地方。其实来这边已经有一个月了，只是之前……没什么记录的兴致。","id":373,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7b/Avg_avg_4208_wintim_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4208_wintim_1#1$2","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","focus":"m","id":374},{"type":"dialogue","name":"女子","text":"没人愿意来这种地方，是那位女大公联系各个研究所提议进行人才交流，之后……哈，我猜，像我这样不受欢迎的人就都被打包送来了。","id":375,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7b/Avg_avg_4208_wintim_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4208_wintim_1#1$2","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","focus":"m","id":376},{"type":"dialogue","name":"女子","text":"这里什么都没有。所有娱乐都无从谈起，物资会有人定期送来，但永远是那几样，就连寄给家里的信都要走上好几个月。","id":377,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7b/Avg_avg_4208_wintim_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4208_wintim_1#1$2","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","focus":"m","id":378},{"type":"dialogue","name":"女子","text":"当然，这是我听其他人闲聊的时候说到的……现在爸妈不在了，我也不需要给谁写信了。","id":379,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7b/Avg_avg_4208_wintim_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4208_wintim_1#1$2","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","focus":"m","id":380},{"type":"dialogue","name":"女子","text":"没有任何重要的研究项目被分到这里，经费少得可怜，甚至通常不会真正到我们手里。我本来已经做好了最坏的打算。","id":381,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7b/Avg_avg_4208_wintim_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4208_wintim_1#1$2","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","focus":"m","id":382},{"type":"dialogue","name":"女子","text":"直到我意识到……也许，这反而是因祸得福。","id":383,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7b/Avg_avg_4208_wintim_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":384},{"type":"text","text":"她扯出一个极浅的笑容，眼角的笑纹昭示着岁月的流逝。","id":385},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4208_wintim_1#1$2","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","focus":"m","id":386},{"type":"dialogue","name":"女子","text":"与其说是研究所，这里更像是给矿区配备的医院兼殡仪馆。","id":387,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7b/Avg_avg_4208_wintim_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4208_wintim_1#1$2","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","focus":"m","id":388},{"type":"dialogue","name":"女子","text":"只要他们被送到这里时还有救，我多少能做些什么。我还是第一次这样感谢自己这些年来被迫涉猎的那许多不同学科。","id":389,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7b/Avg_avg_4208_wintim_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4208_wintim_1#1$2","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","focus":"m","id":390},{"type":"dialogue","name":"女子","text":"至于那些已经无力回天的……我们需要将他们的遗体无害化处理。这不怎么叫人好受，但总比做杀人的帮凶好些。","id":391,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7b/Avg_avg_4208_wintim_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":392},{"type":"text","text":"她略作停顿。","id":393},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4208_wintim_1#1$2","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","focus":"m","id":394},{"type":"dialogue","name":"女子","text":"这里的研究员不在意谁是哪个学派出身、来自什么家庭、是乌萨斯还是非乌萨斯种族……他们只在乎自己的工资是不是会照常发放。","id":395,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7b/Avg_avg_4208_wintim_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4208_wintim_1#1$2","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","focus":"m","id":396},{"type":"dialogue","name":"女子","text":"在这座毫无自由可言的陆上孤岛，我反而获得了至今为止最大限度的自由。","id":397,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7b/Avg_avg_4208_wintim_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4208_wintim_1#1$2","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","focus":"m","id":398},{"type":"dialogue","name":"女子","text":"挨着矿区，至少不愁没有源石用。我可以用工资补贴经费……我可以重新捡起中断的研究。","id":399,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7b/Avg_avg_4208_wintim_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4208_wintim_1#1$2","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","focus":"m","id":400},{"type":"dialogue","name":"女子","text":"兜兜转转走了那么多地方，我想……就是这里了。","id":401,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7b/Avg_avg_4208_wintim_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4208_wintim_1#1$2","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","focus":"m","id":402},{"type":"dialogue","name":"女子","text":"虽然我已经不确定自己能做到什么地步，但总要试试。也许我可以在这里做出些成果，做些有意义的事——","id":403,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7b/Avg_avg_4208_wintim_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_filmprojection","id":404},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"fi","id":405},{"type":"dialog","id":406},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":407},{"type":"charslot","id":408},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":409},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0","fadetime":"0","keep":"true","id":410},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a9/Avg_bg_66_g10_instituteinterior.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":411},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.5","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":412},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4208_wintim_1#1$2","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","focus":"m","id":413},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"够了……够了，够了！","id":414,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7b/Avg_avg_4208_wintim_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":415},{"type":"text","text":"这次录像没有播放到最后。","id":416},{"type":"text","text":"她几乎是发疯般将录像带从带仓中拽了出来，将塑料壳粗暴地掰裂。","id":417},{"type":"text","text":"本就因冻疮干裂的手指被尖锐处划开一道道伤口，但她却感觉不到疼痛。","id":418},{"type":"dialog","id":419},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4208_wintim_1#1$2","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","focus":"m","id":420},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"瞧瞧我们都做了些什么吧！那些——那些事——根本是魔鬼的行径！","id":421,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7b/Avg_avg_4208_wintim_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4208_wintim_1#1$2","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","focus":"m","id":422},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"我竟然还觉得这里会有所不同——怎么会有所不同？哪里都一样！哪里都一样！","id":423,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7b/Avg_avg_4208_wintim_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":424},{"type":"text","text":"一盘又一盘录像带被撕裂，磁带被大段扯出，染上渗出的鲜血，像是从躯壳中流出黑色的内脏。","id":425},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":426},{"type":"text","text":"她呜咽着，滚烫的泪水灼烧着脸颊，直到——","id":427},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":428},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4208_wintim_1#8$2","focus":"m","duration":"1","id":429},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":430},{"type":"charslot","id":431},{"type":"text","text":"咚！","id":432},{"type":"text","text":"一声震颤砸在心脏上。","id":433},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$nervous_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_nervous_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":434,"musicid":1},{"type":"charslot","id":435},{"type":"dialogue","name":"惊讶的声音","text":"咦，这扇门上了锁！","id":436},{"type":"charslot","id":437},{"type":"dialogue","name":"愤怒的声音","text":"难道还有人？那些*乌萨斯粗口*还有留下的？","id":438},{"type":"text","text":"咚咚咚！","id":439},{"type":"charslot","id":440},{"type":"dialogue","name":"愤怒的声音","text":"开门，给我滚出来！","id":441},{"type":"charslot","id":442},{"type":"dialogue","name":"愤怒的声音","text":"下面有工具，我去拿上来，把门砸开！","id":443},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4208_wintim_1#6$2","focus":"m","id":444},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科谢尼娅","text":"啊……","id":445,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f6/Avg_avg_4208_wintim_1-6$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":446},{"type":"playsound","key":"$bodyfalldown2","id":447},{"type":"text","text":"她跌坐在地，心如死灰。","id":448},{"type":"text","text":"看吧——多么愚蠢，已经来不及了。她就连给自己录下几句遗言这样的小事也做不到，那些愤怒的感染者矿工们已经发现她了。","id":449},{"type":"text","text":"但同时，她的心里又冒出了一个幽灵般的念头。","id":450},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4208_wintim_1#2$2","focus":"m","id":451},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科谢尼娅","text":"……也好，这样也好。","id":452,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8b/Avg_avg_4208_wintim_1-2$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":453},{"type":"text","text":"就这样结束也好。","id":454},{"type":"text","text":"然而事与愿违，她等待了一会儿，听到门外传来模糊的喊声。","id":455},{"type":"charslot","id":456},{"type":"dialogue","name":"楼下的声音","text":"喂！下面人手不够，快过来帮忙！","id":457},{"type":"charslot","id":458},{"type":"dialogue","name":"门外的声音","text":"可这间屋子呢？","id":459},{"type":"charslot","id":460},{"type":"dialogue","name":"楼下的声音","text":"雷尔金说不管它，那些胆小鬼肯定都跑啦！把物资赶快搬回去要紧！","id":461},{"type":"charslot","id":462},{"type":"dialogue","name":"门外的声音","text":"……也是，来了！","id":463},{"type":"text","text":"她听到门外的人走开了。又过了一会儿，所有的嘈杂声都消失了。","id":464},{"type":"text","text":"科谢尼娅犹豫地打开房门。研究所一片死寂。","id":465},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4208_wintim_1#3$2","focus":"m","id":466},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科谢尼娅","text":"哈……哈哈……","id":467,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_avg_4208_wintim_1-3$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4208_wintim_1#3$2","focus":"m","id":468},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科谢尼娅","text":"看来，一切终究不会简单顺了我的心意。","id":469,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_avg_4208_wintim_1-3$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":470},{"type":"text","text":"看来，还是得她自己做个了结。","id":471},{"type":"dialog","id":472},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":473},{"type":"charslot","id":474},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":475},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_filmprojection","id":476},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_oldtvelectricity","loop":"true","channel":"fi","id":477},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0.5","fadetime":"0","keep":"true","id":478},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":479},{"type":"text","text":"尘封许久的摄像机被再一次启动，镜头扫过地板上繁复的线路。","id":480},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4208_wintim_1#2$2","focus":"m","id":481},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科谢尼娅","text":"……都布置好了，他们没发现仓库里的炸药……只要引燃，诞生在这里的一切错误都会烟消云散。","id":482,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8b/Avg_avg_4208_wintim_1-2$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4208_wintim_1#2$2","focus":"m","id":483},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科谢尼娅","text":"连同我这几十年来同样堆满错误的人生一起，一切都会结束。","id":484,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8b/Avg_avg_4208_wintim_1-2$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4208_wintim_1#2$2","focus":"m","id":485},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科谢尼娅","text":"……","id":486,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8b/Avg_avg_4208_wintim_1-2$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4208_wintim_1#3$2","focus":"m","id":487},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科谢尼娅","text":"拉古诺夫老师将这台摄像机送给我，是想让我记录下“有意义的瞬间”，是因为相信我终会有所成就……","id":488,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_avg_4208_wintim_1-3$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4208_wintim_1#3$2","focus":"m","id":489},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科谢尼娅","text":"可结果却是它见证了我一生一无所成。","id":490,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_avg_4208_wintim_1-3$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4208_wintim_1#3$2","focus":"m","id":491},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科谢尼娅","text":"我不知道该怪谁，也许该怪我自己……毕竟我能责怪的、本能改变这一切的只有我自己。","id":492,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_avg_4208_wintim_1-3$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4208_wintim_1#8$2","focus":"m","id":493},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科谢尼娅","text":"我本该做到更多的，本能做更多努力，但我没有……不，不对！不对！","id":494,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_4208_wintim_1-8$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":495},{"type":"text","text":"她忽然痉挛般发起抖来，惊怒交加地嘶吼。","id":496},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4208_wintim_1#5$2","focus":"m","id":497},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科谢尼娅","text":"你又在犯老毛病了！你又在重复同样的错误！","id":498,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/37/Avg_avg_4208_wintim_1-5$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4208_wintim_1#5$2","focus":"m","id":499},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科谢尼娅","text":"明明结果已经摆在眼前，明明已经一败涂地，却总妄想再找出一线希望，给自己一个挣扎的借口！","id":500,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/37/Avg_avg_4208_wintim_1-5$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4208_wintim_1#4$2","focus":"m","id":501},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科谢尼娅","text":"没有什么如果，没什么能改变这一切！这没有意义，一切都……没有意义。","id":502,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/02/Avg_avg_4208_wintim_1-4$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":503},{"type":"text","text":"该说的话已经都写下来了，她又在这里磨磨蹭蹭地胡言乱语些什么呢？","id":504},{"type":"text","text":"该结束了，结束这毫无意义的一生。","id":505},{"type":"dialog","id":506},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":507},{"type":"text","text":"摄像机从她的手中滑落，坠入堆满记忆的墓场。","id":508},{"type":"text","text":"麦克风捕捉到的声音变得遥远而飘忽，仍显示“录制中”的画面里，模糊地闪过一抹火光。","id":509},{"type":"text","text":"那是烛火点燃了她本就不准备让任何人看到的遗书，它将代替引火索，为一切画下句号。","id":510},{"type":"text","text":"然而，就在此时，一个明亮的声音蓦地闯入。","id":511},{"type":"charslot","id":512},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":513},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"科谢尼娅！——你是科谢尼娅，对吗？","id":514},{"type":"dialog","id":515},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"fi","fadetime":"3","id":516},{"type":"charslot","id":517},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":518},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0","fadetime":"0","keep":"true","id":519},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/48/Avg_bg_bg_room_2.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":520},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"4","block":"true","id":521},{"type":"animtext","id":522,"name":"group_location_stamp","style":"avg_both","pos":"-400,-200","block":"false","text":"<p=1>罗德岛新基地，干员宿舍</>"},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":523},{"type":"animtextclean","id":524},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":525},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_calm_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":526,"musicid":2},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":527},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":528},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1","focus":"m","duration":"1","id":529},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":530},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弑君者","text":"到了，这里就是你的房间。","id":531,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":532},{"type":"charslot","id":533},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4208_wintim_1#1$1","focus":"m","duration":"2","id":534},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":535},{"type":"dialogue","name":"冬时","text":"好的，谢谢。","id":536,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d8/Avg_avg_4208_wintim_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":537},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弑君者","text":"……","id":538,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4208_wintim_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":539},{"type":"dialogue","name":"冬时","text":"……","id":540,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d8/Avg_avg_4208_wintim_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4208_wintim_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":541},{"type":"dialogue","name":"冬时","text":"呃，要不要坐一会儿？虽然还什么都没来得及收拾，但……你看，我们这么久没见，也许可以说说话。","id":542,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_4208_wintim_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":543},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弑君者","text":"下次吧。之后我还有别的任务，不好久留。行李我给你放在这里——嗯？","id":544,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":545},{"type":"text","text":"塞满文件和杂物的纸箱中，一台老旧的便携式摄像机安静地躺在角落。","id":546},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":547},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弑君者","text":"我记得这东西……小的时候我还拿来玩过，没想到你还留着。","id":548,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4208_wintim_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":549},{"type":"dialogue","name":"冬时","text":"其实本来是打算不要了的，但从远北离开的时候……我还是把它带上了。","id":550,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d8/Avg_avg_4208_wintim_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":551},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弑君者","text":"这么说来，我听后勤的人说你申请采购了几盘老式录像带，就是给它用的？","id":552,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":553},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弑君者","text":"打算拍些什么？","id":554,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4208_wintim_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":555},{"type":"dialogue","name":"冬时","text":"这……","id":556,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/69/Avg_avg_4208_wintim_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4208_wintim_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":557},{"type":"dialogue","name":"冬时","text":"……","id":558,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/69/Avg_avg_4208_wintim_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":559},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弑君者","text":"随口一问，不方便说就算了。","id":560,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bf/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":561},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弑君者","text":"……只是看你捡起了以前的爱好，有点怀念而已。","id":562,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bf/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":563},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":564},{"type":"charslot","id":565},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":566},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_filmprojection","id":567},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":568},{"type":"dialogue","name":"冬时","text":"……我没想到自己会再次启动这台机器。","id":569},{"type":"dialogue","name":"冬时","text":"前些天Mon3tr小姐和博士终于告诉了我当年发生的事。原来……老师他们真的已经不在了。","id":570},{"type":"dialogue","name":"冬时","text":"早年我曾经有过一些更可耻的猜测。猜测是不是大家平安无事，只是为找个借口将我这个拖后腿的踢出去。","id":571},{"type":"dialogue","name":"冬时","text":"后来听说了那些传闻，又开始整日心惊胆颤，生怕再受牵连，竟把天大的幸运污蔑为纠缠不休的厄运，但凡碰壁就开始怨天尤人……","id":572},{"type":"dialogue","name":"冬时","text":"上一次我拿起这台摄像机的时候，居然想要去死。","id":573},{"type":"dialogue","name":"冬时","text":"可既然当年的人只剩下我了，那么我想……这条命已经不再独属于我自己。哪怕是为了完成老师和大家未竟的研究，我也要活下去。","id":574},{"type":"dialogue","name":"冬时","text":"……","id":575},{"type":"dialogue","name":"冬时","text":"我知道这是种恬不知耻的想法，我一事无成，凭什么敢妄言继承那些伟大灵魂的意志？","id":576},{"type":"dialogue","name":"冬时","text":"我也知道这万分可笑，这只是我又一次为自己找到的，苟活下去的借口。","id":577},{"type":"dialogue","name":"冬时","text":"但既然我现在还活着……那么，就是这样了。","id":578},{"type":"dialogue","name":"冬时","text":"凯尔希所长留下了一些研究，我有幸获准接手其中一些未完成的内容。","id":579},{"type":"dialogue","name":"冬时","text":"哥伦比亚的一家学术期刊在这个领域最为权威，等论文完成后我打算把它寄过去，看看是否能发表。","id":580},{"type":"dialogue","name":"冬时","text":"我也不知道会不会有回应、这一切是不是真的有意义。所以刚才柳达问我想要拍什么，我也答不上来。","id":581},{"type":"dialogue","name":"冬时","text":"只是我想，无论如何……","id":582},{"type":"dialogue","name":"冬时","text":"我该继续拍下去。","id":583},{"type":"dialog","id":584},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":585},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"4","block":"true","id":586},{"type":"charslot","id":587},{"type":"image","id":588}],"characters":["？？？","年迈的教师","军人","女孩","校长","圆脸女孩","镜头外的声音","菲林研究者","稚嫩的声音","少女","模糊的喊声","青年女子","愤怒的喊声","威严的声音","焦急的喊声","女子","惊讶的声音","愤怒的声音","科谢尼娅","楼下的声音","门外的声音","弑君者","冬时"]}